WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.143 --> 00:00:11.643
In tutorial 11.9, you'll get your client's
yes before a page goes live or a pitch

00:00:11.693 --> 00:00:14.103
goes out, right inside their portal.

00:00:15.153 --> 00:00:19.013
First, on the Clients page,
open your client's workspace.

00:00:19.063 --> 00:00:21.746
Then go to Company settings,
and choose Branding.

00:00:22.696 --> 00:00:26.671
Under Client approvals, switch
on Client approval required.

00:00:26.721 --> 00:00:30.071
Now a page can't go live,
and a pitch can't be sent,

00:00:30.121 --> 00:00:32.306
until your client's approver says yes.

00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:36.650
Next, open Approvals in
the client's workspace.

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:39.850
Everything waiting for your
client's decision is listed here,

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:42.245
pages and outreach pitches alike.

00:00:43.218 --> 00:00:47.243
Each one shows your note and who
asked. Click Read the page to check it,

00:00:47.293 --> 00:00:49.795
or Withdraw request if your plans change.

00:00:50.779 --> 00:00:53.538
To ask for a new yes,
click Ask for approval.

00:00:54.754 --> 00:00:58.804
Under What should they approve,
choose a page or an outreach draft.

00:00:58.854 --> 00:01:02.316
Add a note for your client if you
like, and click Ask for approval.

00:01:03.311 --> 00:01:07.236
Your client's approver finds it
under Approvals, in their own portal.

00:01:07.286 --> 00:01:09.640
They can read the page, and click Approve.

00:01:10.654 --> 00:01:13.779
Or they click Ask for changes,
write what should change,

00:01:13.829 --> 00:01:15.568
and click Send to the agency.

00:01:16.612 --> 00:01:21.797
Back in your workspace, their answer moves
to Decided, as Approved or Changes asked,

00:01:21.847 --> 00:01:22.794
with their note.

00:01:23.803 --> 00:01:28.753
Now nothing goes out before your client
agrees, every answer is kept in one place,

00:01:28.803 --> 00:01:32.617
and the Clients page shows how
many items wait for each client.

00:01:33.636 --> 00:01:39.018
So, require approval, open Approvals, ask
for a yes, and see your client's answer.

00:01:40.090 --> 00:01:45.145
Every yes, on record. Next, update
your name, password and Google sign-in,

00:01:45.195 --> 00:01:47.160
in tutorial 11.10.
